{"title":"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964954d9bad5fbe3f4900f6686444f689809603e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 - 2 + 3 + 5 - 8 + 13 + 21 - 34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"289\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a370d8630d7b1a6222e0311fa605ad6dab1b28d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -32 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 88\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can group it by three to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54ecde1fbc683794d80fec368eaa3fe3eb01da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+1-2)+(3+5-8)+(13+21-34)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef6ed516ceea3a2a08be10234823d8255a1d057c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 + 0 + 0 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"153\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and Mathalausthegreekgod\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href